WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:01.875
- Yo, what's up, man? I gotta get these little legs home.

00:00:01.916 --> 00:00:04.291
- Looks like you wandered into SHUTDOWN CORNER.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.041
- Oh hell ya, it’s the Receiver Corps!

00:00:06.125 --> 00:00:08.708
♪♪♪ - RECEIVER CORPS! You best believe-a... ♪♪♪

00:00:08.708 --> 00:00:10.250
♪♪♪ It’s a job for a diva! ♪♪♪

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:11.416
♪♪♪ RECEIVER CORPS! ♪♪♪

00:00:11.625 --> 00:00:13.041
- [Together:] GO, WIDEOUT, GO!

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:14.041
- Ayo, what's this bear's name?

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:19.416
- The CORNAS have captured our struggling QBs.

00:00:19.666 --> 00:00:21.666
We need our top receiver to bail them out again.

00:00:21.833 --> 00:00:22.541
- OK, fine.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:23.791
I'll go.

00:00:23.875 --> 00:00:24.583
- [Together, laughing]

00:00:24.583 --> 00:00:28.375
- For real, though. I can’t do it cuz I’m the only one who will receive
Aaron’s nightly ramblings.

00:00:28.458 --> 00:00:31.333
- Hey, Davante, tonight we’re gonna prove how the CIA killed JFK.

00:00:31.541 --> 00:00:33.708
- I should go. DK can tackle anything. 

00:00:33.708 --> 00:00:36.000
- BOOO!
- That was one time, dude
- We play offense!

00:00:36.208 --> 00:00:36.625
- Nuk? 

00:00:37.166 --> 00:00:38.166
- Can't. Got a thing.

00:00:38.666 --> 00:00:39.291
- He's so cool.

00:00:39.291 --> 00:00:40.458
- I got a thing too because we’re the same. 

00:00:40.625 --> 00:00:41.000
- Mike?

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:44.083
- I refuse to help. But only because my feelings are hurt.

00:00:44.291 --> 00:00:46.166
- This may be a job for our new weapon.

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:48.208
- Let’s just say it’s gonna be...booming.

00:00:48.208 --> 00:00:49.791
- [Together:] IT'S A LITERAL TICKING TIME BOMB!

00:00:49.833 --> 00:00:50.583
- [Together:] AHHH!!!!

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:51.625
- Set me free.

00:00:52.041 --> 00:00:54.000
- LOOK, WE'LL NEVER TRULY BE KIDNAPPED
UNLESS WE’RE KIDS AT HEART—

00:00:54.041 --> 00:00:54.250
- Let.

00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:54.750
- Jones.

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:55.083
- Run.

00:00:55.083 --> 00:00:55.625
- Trust. 

00:00:55.625 --> 00:00:55.875
- Us.

00:00:55.875 --> 00:00:57.000
- [Daniel Jones:] I’M ALMOST FREE!

00:00:57.166 --> 00:00:58.958
OH, OW, OW, O—
[Loud crash]

00:01:02.708 --> 00:01:04.916
- Yo, I’m Robby Anderson, and this is Sir Purr.

00:01:05.125 --> 00:01:05.916
Ya, we call him that. 

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:09.291
I didn’t know, but Sir Purr is a panther, not a bear.

00:01:09.791 --> 00:01:12.250
Now he’s my best friend. And we go on adventures together.

00:01:12.375 --> 00:01:13.750
We solve crimes and s--t. 

00:01:14.208 --> 00:01:15.333
It's dope as f--k

00:01:15.333 --> 00:01:16.041
And now you know.

00:01:16.416 --> 00:01:17.875
- AND KNOWING IS HALF THE BATTLE.

